WEBVTT

00:08:56.282 --> 00:09:00.578
is in charge of regulating and overseeing
the oil and gas industry.

00:09:00.619 --> 00:09:06.041
You know, historically it was
supposed to regulate the railroad,

00:09:06.041 --> 00:09:10.462
but then when Texas became, you know,
the massive oil and gas producer,

00:09:10.504 --> 00:09:14.550
they switched the responsibilities
of the Railroad Commission to oil and gas,

00:09:14.592 --> 00:09:16.260
but they didn't change the name.

00:09:16.302 --> 00:09:19.680
So a lot of people don't even know
what the Railroad Commission does.

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:22.933
And historically, all the commissioners,
there's three of them,

00:09:22.975 --> 00:09:27.146
they've worked for the very industry
that they're supposed to regulate, right?

00:09:27.146 --> 00:09:28.897
Which means they do nothing.

00:09:29.815 --> 00:09:33.152
I don't know if people
that are watching know about this